{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggBoUjJiVUzXT2ivReuY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fitted all four bands at once with the full ligand-field matrices for octahedral d⁸ (Tanabe–Sugano, worked in the hole picture). All energies below are measured from the ³A₂g ground state.\n\n**Matrices used**\n- ³T₂g = 10Dq (no mixing with other states).\n- ³T₁g: a 2×2 matrix mixing the t₂⁵e³ and t₂⁴e⁴ configurations. Diagonal terms are (−2Dq + 4B) and (8Dq − 5B), and the off-diagonal term is 6B. Its two roots give ³T₁g(F) and ³T₁g(P).\n- ¹Eg: a 2×2 matrix with diagonal terms (−12Dq + 2C) and (8Dq + B + 2C), and off-diagonal term −2√3·B. The lower root gives ¹Eg(D).\n- The ground-state energy subtracted from each is −12Dq − 8B.\n\n**First pass: reading values straight off the bands**\n- 10Dq = 7400 → Dq = 740.\n- The two ³T₁g energies add up to 30Dq + 15B = 36 500, so B ≈ 953.\n- Putting the ¹E band at 15 150 into its matrix then gives C ≈ 4090.\n- Check: these values predict the ³T₁ bands at 12 500 and 24 000, against 12 660 and 23 840 observed. The 160 cm⁻¹ misses show the simple model cannot fit every band exactly.\n\n**Least-squares fit to all four bands (adopted)**\n\n| Band | Calculated | Observed |\n|---|---|---|\n| ³T₂g | 7 481 | 7 400 |\n| ³T₁g(F) | 12 603 | 12 660 |\n| ³T₁g(P) | 23 845 | 23 840 |\n| ¹Eg | 15 150 | 15 150 |\n\nThe fit gives Dq ≈ 748 cm⁻¹, B ≈ 934 cm⁻¹ and C ≈ 4160 cm⁻¹, so C/B ≈ 4.5. B is about 90 % of the free Ni²⁺ ion value (~1040 cm⁻¹), which fits the weak nephelauxetic effect expected for fluoride.\n\nIf 10Dq is instead fixed exactly at 7400, you get Dq = 740, B ≈ 953 and C ≈ 4090 cm⁻¹. The two parameter sets differ by about 2–3 %, which is roughly how precisely this four-band data set pins them down.\n\n{\"Dq\": 748, \"B\": 934, \"C\": 4157, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Least-squares fit of all four bands to full octahedral d8 ligand-field matrices.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":696,"cache_read_input_tokens":3443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":696,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"549e2783-80f6-4e5f-873f-9ac46eeb6a75","uuid":"5c3d9b45-491a-4b37-819d-5a53670c85da","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:54:54.873Z","request_id":"req_011CggBoUPDGeC7eZCty919K"}
